-semiformal-embedding\">18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding</a> 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\exists m,r&lt;\\omega\\;D^{\\omega+m}_r(\\{F\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\exists m,r&lt;\\omega\\;D^{\\omega+m}_r(\\{F\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名以兼容已有入口，结论与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"251b8cab45b0242d\" href=\"?note=251b8cab45b0242d\" title=\"18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding\">18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding</a> 一致。源页码和证明审阅状态沿用原记录；本轮没有新增原书页码核验或证明助理验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nt]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"251b8cab45b0242d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"251b8cab45b0242d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","locatio